                        ],
                        "form": "ква̀зинау́чны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным квазинаука"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "323c2441-ec5e-4eab-97e9-032306619463",
                                "sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                                "text": "И вот, в целях эпатирования публики, с одной стороны, и стремясь подчеркнуть, с другой, ироническое отношение к надоевшей нам иностранщине, я предложил Давиду использовать пародийный прием, обозначив вещи квазинаучными терминами, мольеровской латынью."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad20784f-abc2-48b9-8a2d-f6849faa529e",
                        "source_entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "target_lang_word": "pseudoscientific",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pseudoscientific",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                        "entry_id": "259eb011-bfcc-3378-963c-dbf49067679f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to, or employing pseudoscience; not scientific, though purporting to be scientific."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c980ba-6af6-49dc-ad40-db6f34770269",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "[…] another example of the desire to control deviant lifestyles: the preparation by the FBI of pseudoscientific \"profiles\" that purport to describe the murderers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e8e3a2e-df5c-4d29-a095-119b59694476",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Many postsecondary educators are concerned about the rising tide of pseudoscientific, fundamentally anti-intellectual belief among otherwise well educated Americans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b0ad747-c00b-4a2c-93f3-4cebb6590494",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Some pseudoscientific theories explain what nonbelievers cannot even observe, for example, orgone energy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f65813-9d7a-4f91-91ad-f828dd698055",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Don’t let manipulative state legislators misrepresent science and fearmonger you into giving them money. At the very least, don’t let them continue with their false pseudoscientific assertions. Pressure them to do their jobs and introduce real evidence-based legislation – like the Equality Act – that will improve lives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cac54cac-da5c-4939-8c97-e854bb709d5b",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "The trolls did not match the old professional racists’ stuffy style, but they found use in their pseudoscientific graphics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "38ee42f3-e19b-4131-a395-85eed922b78b",
                        "source_entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "target_lang_word": "quasi-scientific",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quasi-scientific",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e5ebd33-f8a7-350c-9024-99cbbb39f338",
                                        "entry_id": "e7aa8095-4a45-3274-b204-bf7c85fa3b56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seemingly scientific, especially by using the language but not the methods or rigour of science."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12ddedf7-b4fe-4a83-8be3-597a69e7277d",
                                                "sense_id": "7e5ebd33-f8a7-350c-9024-99cbbb39f338",
                                                "text": "There are endless amounts of information at your finger tips; quasi-scientific bullshit, utterly terrible advice and uninformed answers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c360b189-0ad3-4765-8837-d58c907f034c",
                        "source_entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "target_lang_word": "seudocientífico",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "seudocientífico",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe1e7c52-6cf5-3757-8a2c-495c94754e0f",
                                        "entry_id": "a4efb522-bdee-3e44-9cad-ef107349367f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que pretende ser científico sin serlo. Propio de la seudociencia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8cd1bfb-2cdc-449b-9708-70e828dbed2c",
                                                "sense_id": "fe1e7c52-6cf5-3757-8a2c-495c94754e0f",
                                                "text": "Sin embargo, pocas personas están en posibilidad de distinguir si se trata de una propuesta seudocientífica o, bien, de algún tipo de especulación de vanguardia por completo válida."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "709a2c89-d65f-4b2f-b6db-ba3d8d02a055",
                        "source_entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "target_lang_word": "gelehrttuerisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7459e32-a012-4b82-a032-c962c8b5b790",
                        "source_entry_id": "90c19d9f-3541-3c99-9ffb-22cdbace6305",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d5f559a-e7a7-3ccd-aed4-6f76e0863786",
                        "target_lang_word": "pseudo-scientifique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pseudo-scientifique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7065d98d-3634-37fe-97e5-fa794d6e3fd4",
                                        "entry_id": "7aadf61f-b54f-3746-b5c8-31d70d19209e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne excerçant de la pseudo-science."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pseudo-sciences"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd0a7c5b-2427-4c1a-a03e-d40167148c6f",
                                                "sense_id": "7065d98d-3634-37fe-97e5-fa794d6e3fd4",
                                                "text": "Au lieu de se donner la peine de consulter des travaux de référence ou d'enquêter directement, ses partisans sortent simplement de leur chapeau des \"faits\" artificiels lorsqu'ils en ont besoin. Ces fictions représentent souvent leurs argumentation et conclusion principales. En outre, les pseudo-scientifiques évoluent rarement. L'édition première d'un livre pseudo-scientifique est toujours la dernière, même si celle-ci date de plusieurs décennies ou siècles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pseudo-scientifique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a749591-3e4d-3a1a-8c17-8fca26b90395",
                                        "entry_id": "959310c2-e188-374f-8f91-60d0bf10b90c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à une ou plusieurs pseudosciences."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fec27a2-c636-418d-8a05-767b86c17a1c",
                                                "sense_id": "3a749591-3e4d-3a1a-8c17-8fca26b90395",
                                                "text": "La \"respiration consciente\" promue par Innovzen s'inspire, en effet, de nombreux courants comme le Rebirth, développé par l'Américain Leonard Orr et signalé comme une pratique pseudo-scientifique par la Mission interministérielle de vigilance et de lutte contre les dérives sectaires (Miviludes)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ae14fd8-676f-4cda-bd71-051e5d682360",
                                                "sense_id": "3a749591-3e4d-3a1a-8c17-8fca26b90395",
                                                "text": "Puisse ce livre étendre le champ de cette révolution, et permettre aux idées nouvelles de balayer le fatras de croyances pseudo-scientifiques, issues bien souvent du siècle dernier, qui encombre l’esprit de nos contemporains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
